Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool_full"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination using inverse error weights on the full pool to see if it improves over the mean baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a robust median combination on the full model pool to see if it improves over the mean baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool_full"}

Thought: Test a trimmed‑mean on the full pool to see if trimming extreme outliers improves over the mean baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool_full","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Test a robust DBA combination on the full pool to see if it outperforms the mean baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool_full","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a simple mean combination on the smaller, trend‑strong pool1 to see if removing weaker models helps.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool1"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination on pool2 with inverse_error to see if adding rf improves performance over pool1 mean.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool2","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination on the full pool using the pooled_meta_model weight handle (w1) to see if a meta‑model based weighting improves over the simple inverse‑error weighted mean.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"w1"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination using inverse_error weights on the smaller, trend‑strong pool1 to see if focusing on the top trend models improves over the mean baseline on that pool.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool1","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination on pool3 (which adds rf to pool2) using inverse_error to see if the extra model improves over pool2 results.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool3","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a median combination on the larger pool2 to see if a robust central tendency improves over the mean baseline.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool2"}

Thought: Evaluate a trimmed‑mean on the trend‑strong pool1 to see if trimming extreme errors improves over the mean baseline.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool1","trim_pct":0.2}

